## Everyday commands

| Command | What it does |
| --- | --- |
| `node scripts/check.mjs quick` | Guards, lint, format, types and unit tests (run after every change). |
| `node scripts/check.mjs full` | Everything in `quick` plus coverage, scanner fixtures and the dependency audit. |
| `node scripts/test-profile.mjs <profile>` | Run a test profile: `quick`, `full`, `chaos`, `hardening`, `release`, `live`. |
| `node scripts/scaffold.mjs feature <id> --summary "…"` | Add a feature with its scenarios and registry entries. |
| `node scripts/run-deploy-tasks.mjs --env staging --sha <sha>` | Plan post-deploy tasks (add `--yes` to run them). |

Every command exits `0` pass, `1` the tool broke, `2` a policy or gate finding, `130` interrupted.

## Lanes

- **local**: your machine. See "Getting started".
- **staging**: every push to `<%= it.spec.lanes.branches.staging %>` deploys automatically and runs smoke checks.
- **prod**: only the `<%= it.spec.lanes.branches.prod %>` branch deploys, through the manual promote workflow.

See [DEPLOY.md](DEPLOY.md) for the deploy class and the promotion rules.

